    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_91#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1106,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_91",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Sorry. I'm not in the mood for talking... I'd rather just have another drink.",
      "JA_current": "すまない。今は話せる気分じゃないんだ… 一杯飲みたい気分だぜ。",
      "JA_new": "悪いな。今は話す気分じゃない……もう一杯飲みたいんだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start",
          "phrase_id": "91",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_711#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1070,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_711",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Can you tell me anything that would be useful to a rookie?",
      "JA_current": "新米に何か役に立つ話はないか？",
      "JA_new": "新米に何か役立つ話はないか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start",
          "phrase_id": "711",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_82#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1079,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_82",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Are you Baldy? I need to talk to you.",
      "JA_current": "あんたが Baldy かい？ ちょっと話があるんだが。",
      "JA_new": "あんたがBaldyか？ 話がある。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start",
          "phrase_id": "82",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_7111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1073,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_7111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "If you haven't been in the Arena, I'd recommend it - it's a good way to make money and show everyone what you can do. Not everyone has the balls to fight the next monster and that's a pity! Man, as soon as I save up enough cash for decent armor, I'm there.",
      "JA_current": "アリーナに立ったことがないなら、すすめるよ ― 金を稼ぎ、お前の力を皆に示す、良い方法だ。皆が皆、怪物もどきと戦うために自分の玉を握んなきゃいけないわけじゃない、遺憾だがね！ やれやれ、まともな装備のための現金が十分に出来たのなら、俺はすぐそこにいるよ。",
      "JA_new": "アリーナに出たことがないなら、行ってみるといい。金も稼げるし、自分の腕を皆に見せられる。次の怪物に挑む度胸のある奴は少ない。もったいない話だよ！ 俺もまともな防具を買えるだけ貯めたら、すぐ参加するつもりだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start",
          "phrase_id": "7111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_83#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1082,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_83",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Suppose I am. What do you want?",
      "JA_current": "だったらどうした？ 何か用かい？",
      "JA_new": "そうだとしたら？ 何の用だ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start",
          "phrase_id": "83",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_84#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1085,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_84",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Spotty got saved from the Red Forest, but Hunchback is dead.",
      "JA_current": "Spotty が Red Forest から救出されたが、Hunchback は死んじまった。",
      "JA_new": "Spottyは赤い森から救出された。でもHunchbackは死んだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start",
          "phrase_id": "84",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_85#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1088,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_85",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Dammit!",
      "JA_current": "ちくしょう！",
      "JA_new": "くそっ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start",
          "phrase_id": "85",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_86#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1091,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_86",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Spotty is in bad shape, his brain doesn't work anymore. Maybe you can talk to him? We need to find out the Scorcher's schedule.",
      "JA_current": "Spotty は酷い有様で、頭がやられちまってる。アンタ、ヤツと話せるかい？ Scorcherが放出するスケジュールを知りたいんだ。",
      "JA_new": "Spottyはひどい状態だ。もう頭がまともに働いてない。あんたから話を聞けないか？ ブレイン・スコーチャーの放出周期を知りたいんだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start",
          "phrase_id": "86",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_87#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1094,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_87",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "No! Don't ask me to do this. Hunchback is dead 'cause of me and what happened to Spotty is my fault too. I left them, betrayed them, deserted them and ran away! I can't look Spotty in the eyes after what I did!",
      "JA_current": "そんなことできるわけねぇ！ Hunchback はオレのせいで死んだし、Spotty がああなったのもオレの失敗なんだ。オレはヤツらを取り残し、裏切り、見捨てて逃げたんだ！ Spotty に会わせる顔なんてねぇ！",
      "JA_new": "嫌だ！ そんなこと頼まないでくれ。Hunchbackが死んだのは俺のせいだし、Spottyがああなったのも俺のせいだ。二人を置き去りにして、裏切って、見捨てて逃げたんだ！ あんなことをして、Spottyと顔を合わせられるわけがない！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start",
          "phrase_id": "87",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_88#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1097,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_88",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "C'mon, chill man. Tell me what happened.",
      "JA_current": "来な、臆病者。何があったのか話すんだ。",
      "JA_new": "おい、落ち着けよ。何があったか話してくれ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start",
          "phrase_id": "88",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_89#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1100,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_89",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "The three of us were getting ready to try to get through to the North. We didn't know when the Scorcher emissions were lower but Spotty managed to get the info somewhere... I don't know where... We were half-way through the sector, when the Scorcher suddenly switched on again. Spotty passed out straight away and fell down the hillside. I panicked and said that we should leave everything and go back. Hunchback managed to pull himself together and said that we had to get Spotty out... I said \"You're an idiot, don't you wanna live? It's over for him, how are we gonna carry him all the way back?\" Just as he managed to convince me and started to climb down to get Spotty... another wave came. By the time I came to my senses I was by the military base... I thought Hunchback and Spotty stayed there... but Hunchback got him out and didn't make it himself... he got him out...",
      "JA_current": "俺たち3人は、北方にたどり着こうと努力していた。Scorcher の放出が低くなるのが何時なのか知らなかった、だが Spotty が、情報をどこかで何とか入手してきた… どこかは知らない… 途中俺たちは、Sector を通っていた。突然、Scorcher のスイッチが再び入った。すぐに Spotty が気絶して、丘の斜面に倒れた。俺は慌てて、彼を残して戻るべきだ、と言った。何とか落ち着いた Hunchback は、Spotty を救い出だすべきだ、と言った… で、俺は言ったんだ。「お前は馬鹿だ、生きたくないのか？ 彼は終わってる、どうやってあの距離を連れ戻すつもりなんだ？」と。ヤツは何とか俺を納得させ、Spotty を抱えて下り始めた、ちょうどその時だった… 別の波が来たんだ。俺が意識を取り戻した時は、あの軍事基地のそばだった… Hunchback と Spotty もそこにいるものだと思ったが… だが Hunchback は彼を助け出そうとして、自分は助からなかった… ヤツが彼を助けたんだ…。",
      "JA_new": "俺たち三人は、北へ抜けようと準備してた。ブレイン・スコーチャーの放出が弱まるタイミングは分からなかったが、Spottyがどこかで情報を手に入れてきたんだ……どこでかは知らない。区域の半ばまで来た時、突然またブレイン・スコーチャーが作動した。Spottyはすぐ気を失って、斜面を転げ落ちた。俺はパニックになって、荷物なんか捨てて引き返そうと言った。Hunchbackは何とか気を取り直して、Spottyを助けに行かなきゃと言った……俺はこう言ったんだ。「馬鹿野郎、死にたいのか？ あいつはもう助からない。どうやってここから担いで戻るんだ？」って。Hunchbackは何とか俺を説得し、Spottyを助けに斜面を下り始めた……その時、また波が来た。気がついた時には、軍事基地のそばにいた……あいつらもそこに残されたと思ってた。でもHunchbackはSpottyを連れ出してくれた。自分は助からなかったのに……あいつがSpottyを救ったんだ……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start",
          "phrase_id": "89",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_90#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1103,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_90",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "OK, Baldy, OK. Calm down, man. Thanks for telling me what happened. I'll talk to Spotty myself.",
      "JA_current": "わかった Baldy。もう大丈夫だ、落ち着け。話してくれてありがとう。Spotty には俺から話すことにする。",
      "JA_new": "わかった、Baldy。もういい、落ち着け。話してくれてありがとう。Spottyには俺から話してみる。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start",
          "phrase_id": "90",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
