      "EN": "What was Duty doing? They were doing Freedom, what else?",
      "JA_current": "Duty は何してたんだ？ ヤツらは Freedom にかかりっきりで、他には何も？",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_1_start_311#1"
