      ],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Yeah, many people wanted those veterans to \"leave\".",
      "JA_current": "そう、多くの連中が、あのベテランたちが「消え去る」ことを望んでいたからな。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_1_start_511#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "611",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start_611",
      "next": [],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "action",
          "value": "dialogs.break_dialog"
        }
      ],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "61"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "I want to believe that the Scorcher can be switched off.",
      "JA_current": "Scorcher のスイッチも切ることが出来ると信じたいよ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_1_start_611#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "711",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_711",
