      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "71"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Can you tell me anything that would be useful to a rookie?",
      "JA_current": "新米に何か役に立つ話はないか？",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_711#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "82",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_82",
      "next": [
        "83"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "81"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Are you Baldy? I need to talk to you.",
      "JA_current": "あんたが Baldy かい？ ちょっと話があるんだが。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_82#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "7111",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_7111",
      "next": [],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "711"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "If you haven't been in the Arena, I'd recommend it - it's a good way to make money and show everyone what you can do. Not everyone has the balls to fight the next monster and that's a pity! Man, as soon as I save up enough cash for decent armor, I'm there.",
      "JA_current": "アリーナに立ったことがないなら、すすめるよ ― 金を稼ぎ、お前の力を皆に示す、良い方法だ。皆が皆、怪物もどきと戦うために自分の玉を握んなきゃいけないわけじゃない、遺憾だがね！ やれやれ、まともな装備のための現金が十分に出来たのなら、俺はすぐそこにいるよ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_7111#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "83",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_83",
      "next": [
        "84"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
