      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Suppose I am. What do you want?",
      "JA_current": "だったらどうした？ 何か用かい？",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_83#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "84",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_84",
      "next": [
        "85"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "83"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Spotty got saved from the Red Forest, but Hunchback is dead.",
      "JA_current": "Spotty が Red Forest から救出されたが、Hunchback は死んじまった。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_84#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "85",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_85",
      "next": [
        "86"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "84"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Dammit!",
      "JA_current": "ちくしょう！",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_85#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "86",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_86",
      "next": [
        "87"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "85"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Spotty is in bad shape, his brain doesn't work anymore. Maybe you can talk to him? We need to find out the Scorcher's schedule.",
      "JA_current": "Spotty は酷い有様で、頭がやられちまってる。アンタ、ヤツと話せるかい？ Scorcherが放出するスケジュールを知りたいんだ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_86#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "87",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_87",
      "next": [
        "88"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "86"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "No! Don't ask me to do this. Hunchback is dead 'cause of me and what happened to Spotty is my fault too. I left them, betrayed them, deserted them and ran away! I can't look Spotty in the eyes after what I did!",
      "JA_current": "そんなことできるわけねぇ！ Hunchback はオレのせいで死んだし、Spotty がああなったのもオレの失敗なんだ。オレはヤツらを取り残し、裏切り、見捨てて逃げたんだ！ Spotty に会わせる顔なんてねぇ！",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_87#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "88",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_14_start_88",
      "next": [
        "89"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
