      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "C'mon, chill man. Tell me what happened.",
      "JA_current": "来な、臆病者。何があったのか話すんだ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_14_start_88#1"
      ]
    },
